PriorPose

This codebase is derived in part from AG-Pose and retains its MIT license and
copyright notice. The NOCS/HouseCat6D evaluation code is adapted from AG-Pose,
NOCS, DualPoseNet and CATRE as identified in the corresponding source headers.
The bundled PointNet++ CUDA extension retains its upstream source headers.

DINOv2 source is obtained from its official repository by the setup script.
The supplied model checkpoint includes the frozen DINOv2-S/14 backbone
parameters from Meta AI. DINOv2 code and model weights are provided under the
Apache License 2.0; see third_party/DINOv2-LICENSE and
https://github.com/facebookresearch/dinov2.
